  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In the eighth layer of Crazed Demon Cave, after Ice Crystal Immortal Monarch seals Nie Kuang Feng in a mountain-like ice coffin with Extreme Ice Crystal Light Immortal Suppression Coffin, cracks spread from inside and the coffin threatens to fail. Xiao He Jian finishes preparing this immortal killer move and slashes his palms down like blades at the trapped Nie Kuang Feng, aiming the strike into those cracks. Nie Kuang Feng’s body shakes at once; further strikes weaken the green tornado and its resistance until it offers surrender, which Xiao He Jian refuses on his master’s orders, and Nie Kuang Feng dies under the two variant human Gu Immortals.",
